menu "GM Synth bring-up"

config GM_SYNTH_PCM_ARENA_BYTES
    int "PCM PSRAM arena size (bytes)"
    range 1048576 6291456
    default 4194304
    help
        Initial M0/M3 PCM residency arena reserved from external PSRAM.
        The default is intentionally conservative (4 MiB) on an 8 MiB N16R8
        target so later Voice/FX/index/system allocations retain headroom.
        This is a bring-up value, not the final production memory budget.

endmenu
